<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina likely to sell mortgage bank - chairman.</title>
<headline>Argentina likely to sell mortgage bank - chairman.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Argentine government will probably announce later in the day the privatization of its mortgage bank Banco Hipotecario, the institution's chairman Pablo Rojo said Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;That's probable,&quot; Rojo told reporters who inquired about press reports that President Carlos Menem's administration might announce the sale of the bank, whose value has been estimated at between $3.0 to $3.5 billion.</p>
<p>Rojo said the announcement could be made after the weekly cabinet meeting that he was going to attend in the morning, the state-run Telam news agency reported.</p>
<p>-- David Haskel, Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0652</p>
